('127.889.d.19.A',3,'A student labels the float bowl, venturi, throttle plate and main jet of a carburetor. She is:','["labeling tires", "labeling lights", "identifying carburetor components", "labeling seats"]'::jsonb,2,'Carb parts.','original'),
