('127.889.d.19.E',4,'The idle mixture is often set by finding the setting that gives:','["lowest rpm", "maximum fuel", "stalling", "a slight rpm rise as the mixture is leaned (peak rpm)"]'::jsonb,3,'Peak rpm.','original'),
